          "text": "So x equals three.",
          "display": "x = 3",
          "cue": "answer"
        },
        {
          "id": "b06",
          "text": "Watch out for these traps. If you add four x instead of subtracting it, you get fifteen over thirteen. If you subtract seven instead of adding it, you get one over five.",
